{"id":"n88288-3-7","stage":4,"title":"휘젓다 · 挥舞","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88288-3-7-1","ko":"주사를 팔에 놓나요?","zh":"是要在手臂上打针吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주사를","meaning":"注射","explanation":"주사：注射；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91770","senseId":"1","lemma":"주사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔에","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓나요?","meaning":"注射，扎","explanation":"놓다：注射，扎；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"19","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"32b004ef02722e1b","term":"주사","zh":"注射","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3","entryId":"91770","definition":"用注射器直接往人或动物体内注射药液。","pronunciation":["주ː사"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"注射，扎","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"以治疗为目的给患者刺针头。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/073afe47774b08ed3ecb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88288-3-7-2","ko":"네. 아이가 팔을 휘젓지 못하도록 좀 잡아 주세요.","zh":"是的。请稍微按住手臂，别让孩子乱动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔을","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휘젓지","meaning":"挥舞","explanation":"휘젓다：挥舞；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"휘젓다","audio":"/audio/6717bd21b5949f142e17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88288","senseId":"3","lemma":"휘젓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못하도록","meaning":"不，未能","explanation":"못하다：不，未能；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26841","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡아","meaning":"抓，揪","explanation":"잡다：抓，揪；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"6717bd21b5949f14","term":"휘젓다","zh":"挥舞","audio":"/audio/6717bd21b5949f142e17.mp3","entryId":"88288","definition":"猛烈地到处挥动。","pronunciation":["휘젇따"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不，未能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26841","definition":"表示无法到达之前的话所指的状态。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，揪","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"用手握住不放。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a225595498135d9d38be.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88288","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是要在手臂上打针吗？","是的。请稍微按住手臂，别让孩子乱动。","听说您要在隔壁社区再开一家店是吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是要在手臂上打针吗？","是的。请稍微按住手臂，别让孩子乱动。","听说您要在隔壁社区再开一家店是吗？"],"answer":1}]}
